{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/3f4ab0da128a4d870b77427c40908216.avif?t=1774410178\" width=616 height=162 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/595b501559c622d70941e8eed8d1d84a.poster.avif?t=1774410178\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/595b501559c622d70941e8eed8d1d84a.webm?t=1774410178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/595b501559c622d70941e8eed8d1d84a.mp4?t=1774410178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the day winds down, she's there on your desktop, quietly awaiting your return. Will you choose to spend some special time with your other waifu tonight? (She might just be wearing something special...)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/81a74f7e91e45be098af6f1356b9f00b.avif?t=1774410178\" width=616 height=162 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/7a984488c4352eae626594fc10737d9b.poster.avif?t=1774410178\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/7a984488c4352eae626594fc10737d9b.webm?t=1774410178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/7a984488c4352eae626594fc10737d9b.mp4?t=1774410178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The card table is her stage, reserved just for you. Win each game to unlock enticing outfits, letting your other waifu glow with captivating charm under the evening lights. Can you see that hint of a blush?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/436bf739b6c2f916be713c15222faf4e.avif?t=1774410178\" width=616 height=162 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/50092843f6612f7d46b80573356f3414.poster.avif?t=1774410178\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/50092843f6612f7d46b80573356f3414.webm?t=1774410178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723680/extras/50092843f6612f7d46b80573356f3414.mp4?t=1774410178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple keyboard taps and mouse clicks could speed up unlocking your other waifu's next outfit. Every action builds towards gifting her a new look... Want to see her shine even brighter? Feel free to interact as you work or study \u2013 she'll be patiently waiting. And when night falls again, she'll be right there on your desktop, ready for your next &quot;secret game&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hairs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723680/4148e5f4e31df3e6f4a7e51319d306b47ed4f26d.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723680/380a9eac4d4a